2.	To calculate the yield we have used the Statistics Canada formula, under which the investment is deemed to be opening investments plus closing investments, less earnings, divided by two. On this basis, the yield is:
(a)	7.89 per cent;
(b)	11.22 per cent;
(c)	12.75 per cent.
